feature ccmp for DFLT : ipa-tone
feature ccmp for DFLT : ipa-tone-l
feature ccmp for DFLT : ipa-tone-fin

remap group ipa-tone
remap group ipa-tone-l reversed after ipa-tone
remap group ipa-tone-fin after ipa-tone-l

// all segments can be classified in five groups depending on
// which edges of the starting pixel are fully in those segments:
//
// - h(igh):     down and right edges, +1 < slope
// - p(ositive): left and up edges, 0 < slope < +1
// - z(ero):     left and right edges, slope = 0
// - n(egative): left and down edges, -1 < slope < 0
// - l(ow):      up and right edges, slope < -1
//
//     /   /     __--
//    /   /  __--                 n          l
// +-/-+ /  +---+__--  +---+--  +---+      +---+
// |/  |/   |__--      |   |    |~~--      |\  |\
// +---+    +---+      +---+--  +---+~~--  +-\-+ \
//   h        p          z       ~~--         \   \
//                                   ~~--      \   \

// placeholder glyphs for tail letters
glyph tone-($1..5) 8 16
//ref tone-bar-($-1)-l // for debugging
//ref 1x13 1 1

### pass 1: identify all tail letters

remap ipa-tone : tone-bar-($1..5)-l -> tone-($1..5) : tone-bar-($1..5)-l

